WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.540
Today I am leaving the house where I lived all summer, because we are finally going to my American family.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:12.080
The first challenge was to cram all these suitcases into the car, and we did it as best we could, so the trip can begin.

3
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:17.840
We set off for Boston, which takes about four hours, but with good company the time went by far too fast.

4
00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:28.660
I was really sorry when we arrived in Boston, because there I already had to say goodbye to my friends and continue the trip alone.

5
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:31.730
And the next stop is New York, and I am going there by bus.

6
00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:37.820
I do not know if I am the only one, but I really like travelling by bus, especially when it is new and half empty.

7
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:42.280
Honestly I am too excited to sleep, so I ate McDonald's and watched The Mentalist.

8
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:49.790
And since Americans overdo the air conditioning, so as not to freeze I changed into pyjamas, and that was a very big mistake,

9
00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:58.360
because I did not know the bus would leave us in the centre of New York, so I found myself between the Empire State Building and Times Square in pyjamas.

10
00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:03.880
Out of embarrassment I immediately took an Uber to the airport, and I only needed to drop off the big suitcases for storage on the way.

11
00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:12.900
When I booked it online, everything looked legitimate, but the Uber stops by some ghetto houses and I think, what is this, when there is a sign here for leaving suitcases.

12
00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:23.400
Guys, it is one in the morning, I do not have much choice, so I put the suitcases with my valuable things into shopping carts, as it says, and prayed that everything would be okay, so you pray for me too.

13
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:29.120
And finally I reached the airport, which was almost empty, so I slept both in the airport and on the plane.

14
00:01:29.260 --> 00:01:40.000
The flight took a little under two hours and I got to Charlotte around eight in the morning and could hardly wait to get off, because I am so excited to see my American family and house after four years.

15
00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:44.880
The feeling of being here again is unreal, because I thought it would never come back, but here it is.

16
00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:56.240
Officially I am back in my American room, and thank you for travelling with me, and see you next time. Bye!
